OL,3,GNEWSAHow fields of Fermanagh helped
OL,4,ADaisy Edgar-Jones prepare for her
OL,5,Alatest film
OL,6,
OL,7,FActor Daisy Edgar-Jones is no stranger
OL,8,Fto Ireland, having spent five months in
OL,9,Fthe country filming hit drama Normal
OL,10,FPeople which was released in 2020.
OL,12,FBut it was actually fields in County
OL,13,FFermanagh, where some of her family
OL,14,Flive, that helped her prepare for the
OL,15,Frole of beloved character Elinor
OL,16,FDashwood in Jane Austen's Sense and
OL,17,FSensibility, some 20 years before.
OL,19,FHer mother is from County Down and
OL,20,FEdgar-Jones spent her childhood roaming
OL,21,Ffields in Northern Ireland.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,415,410,260,120,0,100
