OL,3,GNEWSAHow fields of Fermanagh helped
OL,4,ADaisy Edgar-Jones prepare for her
OL,5,Alatest film
OL,6,
OL,7,F"I remember big long summers when I was
OL,8,Fvery young in Fermanagh in the fields
OL,9,Fwhich definitely helped with my Sense
OL,10,Fand Sensibility journey because I was
OL,11,Fdoing a lot of the similar wandering
OL,12,Faround, with not much to do, under the
OL,13,Fbig sky and I love being here," she
OL,14,Ftold BBC News NI.
